        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0180 3/4\" Offset Top Pivot Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3/4\" offset top pivot hinge is engineered for durability on standard to heavy doors. Set includes top pivot (for top of the door) with installation hardware. These are used standard with most 3/4\" offset <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Mfg Door Pivots</b></a>.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0180-top-pivot_size.gif?v=1704354718\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0180 Top Pivot Hinge Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0180 Top Door Pivot\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 600 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Leaf Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Leaf Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with needle bearings</li>\r\n<li>US32D model UL listed for use on 3 hour fire doors</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Handed, Reversible </b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0180-install.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0180 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0180-template.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0180 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually <b>\r\n</p>",
